---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Join us">
  <div class="content-page">
    <p>We welcome interest from researchers and students who want to study language development using computational models and naturalistic data of experience, behavior, and brain.</p>
    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="glad">
      <h2 id="glad">GLAD project: upcoming recruitment</h2>
      <p>Our team has been awarded funding from the French National Research Agency (ANR) for <i>Grounded Language Development: A Unified Framework for Learnability Studies</i> (2026–2030).</p>
      <p>The project will recruit a research engineer and a PhD candidate. Recruitment is on a rolling basis, so we encourage you to contact us early. See the contact details below for informal inquiries.</p>
      <p><a class="btn apply-link" href="/apply/">Apply here</a></p>
    </section>
    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="phd-postdoc">
      <h2 id="phd-postdoc">PhD and postdoctoral research</h2>
      <p>If your interests connect with our research program, get in touch to discuss possible projects and funding routes. Tell us about your background, research interests, and the questions you would like to investigate.</p>
      <p>For PhD research, we can discuss potential funding opportunities in our team or through local PhD fellowships.</p>
      <p>For postdoctoral research, potential funding routes include the <a href="https://marie-sklodowska-curie-actions.ec.europa.eu/">Marie Skłodowska-Curie Actions</a> and the <a href="https://www.fondationfyssen.fr/en/">Fyssen Foundation</a>. Availability and eligibility depend on each call.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="students-visitors">
      <h2 id="students-visitors">Students and visitors</h2>
      <p>For enquiries about master’s research projects, internships, or research visits, write with your interests and proposed dates.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="contact">
      <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="/people/abdellah-fourtassi/">Abdellah Fourtassi</a><br />Laboratoire d’Informatique et Systèmes<br />Aix-Marseille University</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>


<style>
  .apply-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0.55em 1.2em;
    font-size: 0.875em;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .apply-link, .apply-link:visited {
    color: #fff;
    background-color: #a83232;
  }
  .apply-link:hover, .apply-link:focus-visible {
    color: #fff;
    background-color: #872727;
  }
</style>
